<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edged down to 15,150 from 15,100 in.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edged down to 15,150 from 15,100 in.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 15,150 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 15,100 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    November 18	 November 15</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,150		15,100</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $2.725 million	  $3.645 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
